WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:03.137
(machines beeping)

00:00:22.246 --> 00:00:24.246
(gasps)

00:00:26.014 --> 00:00:27.400
- You're dead, Wheeler.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.233
Dead.

00:00:31.038 --> 00:00:35.731
♪ We can beat them ♪

00:00:35.731 --> 00:00:38.935
