00:00:57.735 --> 00:00:59.818
- [Boy] Four, three, two.

00:01:02.654 --> 00:01:03.487
- Mike.

00:01:04.761 --> 00:01:06.388
- [Boy] One.

00:01:06.388 --> 00:01:08.028
