00:01:08.028 --> 00:01:13.028
♪ I will be king ♪

00:01:14.369 --> 00:01:18.578
♪ And you ♪

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:23.578
♪ You will be queen ♪

00:01:25.447 --> 00:01:28.882
♪ Though nothing ♪

00:01:28.882 --> 00:01:33.882
♪ Will drive us away ♪

00:01:34.568 --> 00:01:39.568
♪ We can be heroes ♪

00:01:39.925 --> 00:01:44.925
♪ Just for one day ♪

00:01:45.016 --> 00:01:50.016
♪ We can be us ♪

00:01:50.274 --> 00:01:53.191
♪ Just for one day ♪

00:01:55.959 --> 00:01:57.721
(yells)

00:01:57.721 --> 00:01:59.105
- She broke my arm.

00:01:59.105 --> 00:01:59.938
My arm.

00:01:59.938 --> 00:02:00.771
- Go.

00:02:04.693 --> 00:02:07.568
- Yeah that's right, you better run.

00:02:07.568 --> 00:02:09.902
She's our friend and she's crazy.

00:02:09.902 --> 00:02:12.220
You come down here and she'll kill you.

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:13.540
You hear me?

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.625
She'll kill you sons of bitches.

00:02:16.625 --> 00:02:17.958
She'll kill you.

00:02:19.821 --> 00:02:21.988
(screams)

00:02:25.866 --> 00:02:27.679
- Come on wake up, El, you okay?

00:02:27.679 --> 00:02:28.762
Can you move?

00:02:31.826 --> 00:02:32.826
Help her up.

00:02:33.738 --> 00:02:37.671
♪ And we kissed ♪

00:02:37.671 --> 00:02:41.596
♪ As though nothing could fall ♪

00:02:41.596 --> 00:02:42.429
- Will is that you?

00:02:42.429 --> 00:02:43.980
It's Mike, do you copy?

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:44.813
Over.

00:02:48.327 --> 00:02:49.160
- Will.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:51.820
- Do you know where he is?

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:53.800
Do you know where Will is?

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:54.880
- [Will] Stop it, you're scaring her.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.030
- She should be scared.

00:03:00.037 --> 00:03:00.870
- No.

00:03:07.578 --> 00:03:08.411
- Oh.

00:03:09.536 --> 00:03:10.369
It's okay.

00:03:10.369 --> 00:03:11.924
I got you, I got you.

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:12.757
I got you.

00:03:13.647 --> 00:03:14.980
You did so good.

00:03:20.396 --> 00:03:22.063
- What should we do?

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:25.603
- Call the police.

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:29.850
