00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:30.683
Young lady.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.233
You know you have to pay for those.

00:03:33.233 --> 00:03:34.066
Hey, stop.

00:03:35.645 --> 00:03:36.956
Please.

00:03:36.956 --> 00:03:38.465
You have to pay for those.

00:03:38.465 --> 00:03:39.735
Stop right there.

00:03:39.735 --> 00:03:41.607
Thief, thief.

00:03:41.607 --> 00:03:43.908
(glass shatters)

00:03:43.908 --> 00:03:47.681
♪ And you ♪

00:03:47.681 --> 00:03:52.681
♪ You will be queen ♪

00:03:53.898 --> 00:03:58.121
♪ Though nothing ♪

00:03:58.121 --> 00:04:03.121
♪ Will drive us away ♪

00:04:04.356 --> 00:04:09.053
♪ We can be heroes ♪

00:04:09.053 --> 00:04:10.736
♪ Just for one day ♪

00:04:10.736 --> 00:04:15.736
- Everything I said about you
being a traitor and stuff.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:16.743
